@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@duelId = 01JXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

### Commence a new duel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/duels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leftModelId": "01JXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "rightModelId": "01JXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "promptText": "Build a single-file HTML Pomodoro timer with start/stop and a circular progress ring."
}

###

### Get duel details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/duels/{{duelId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### List duels (Archive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/duels?pageSize=20&continuationToken=
Accept: application/json

###

### Record verdict (Left wins)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/duels/{{duelId}}/verdict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "Left"
}

###

### Download Lab Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/duels/{{duelId}}/report
Accept: text/html
